<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL AUG NET FLAT AT PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL AUG NET FLAT AT PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.20 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.37 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.62 vs   0.53</p>
<p> Sales		   12.41 vs   9.35</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.44 vs   1.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.26 vs   1.71</p>
